  "ai.note": "Fakamatala",
  "ai.orion81Builds": "ʻOku langa ʻa e Orion-81 ʻi he polokalama tuku fakaholo naʻe tohi ʻe he kakai. ʻOku lisi heni koeʻuhi ʻoku ʻikai faʻu ia ʻe he AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Ko e Orion-81 ko e kaveinga kuo fakatupu kotoa ʻe he AI.<\/0> Ko e laine kotoa pē ʻo e koniseti ʻa e Orion-81 naʻe tohi ʻaki e Claude Code, ʻo fakahinohino ʻe he tokotaha kamataʻi. Ko e vaka kotoa, mape, tekisi mo e ongo naʻe fakatupu ʻe he ngaahi meʻangāue naʻe faʻu ʻe he Claude Code. Ko e tokotaha kamataʻi ʻoku ne fili ʻa e meʻa ke langa; ko e Claude Code ʻoku ne fakakaukau ki he founga. Ko e ngaahi tohi tuku fakaholo ʻoku langa ai ʻoku lisi ʻi lalo ʻi he ‘ʻIkai faʻu ʻe AI’. Ko e meʻa ʻe taha ʻoku teʻeki ʻosi pea ʻoku fakahā ʻataʻatā: ko e <1>sivisivi laiseni<\/1> ʻo e koniseti ʻo e kēmi naʻe haʻu mei he fuofua sīpinga GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Naʻe kamata e Orion ʻi he 28 Sepitema 2026 ko ha fuofua sīpinga ʻi he ʻenisini tuku fakaholo Quake III Arena (GPL), mo e ngaahi vaka mei he Elite Dangerous ko e fakaloloma. ʻI he ʻaho uá naʻe hiki e koniseti ʻo e kēmi ki he BuB, ko ha ʻenisini foʻou naʻe tohi ʻaki e Claude Code; naʻe haʻu e ngaahi konga ʻo e kēmi mei he fuofua sīpinga pea liliu hono ngaahi hingoa. Ko e vaʻa 0.3.0 naʻe ʻomi ai ki he kalasi vaka ʻe 16 kotoa ha ngaahi sino foʻou ʻanautolu pē. ʻOku sivisivi ʻe ha vakai ki he fakatatau ki he laiseni pe ʻoku kei maʻu mei he GPL ha konga ʻo e koniseti, pea pe ʻoku ofi ange ʻa e ngaahi fakakaukau vaka ki muʻa ki he meʻa naʻe fakaloloma ai. Naʻe fakahoko ʻi he 8 ʻOkatopa 2026 ha sivi ʻaotomatiki ʻo e tatau ʻo e koniseti ki he tupuʻanga ʻo e fuofua sīpinga GPL, pea ʻoku kei fai e sivisivi ʻe he kau poto ki he ngaahi tatau naʻe maʻu. ʻE toe tohi pe toe fokotuʻu ha meʻa kotoa pē ʻoku maʻu mei ai.",
