  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Koeʻuhi ko hono paʻanga maʻu ʻoku fakataumuʻa ke totongi kinautolu. Ko e kēmi ʻoku kamata faʻu kotoa ʻe he AI koeʻuhi ke lava ke ʻi ai; pea ko e kau tokotaha tā ata kuo totongi ʻoku nau fetongi e ngāue ʻa e AI, ʻo fakahā honau hingoa.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "ʻE lava ke u vaʻinga ʻi he ʻinitaneti?",
  "faq.freePlay": "ʻOku taʻetotongi ke vaʻinga?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ngaahi fehuʻi",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Teʻeki. Ko e vaʻinga lahi ʻi he LAN ʻi he fetuʻutaki tatau ʻoku ngāue he ʻaho ni (talu mei he 0.2.0); ko e vaʻinga ʻi he ʻinitaneti teʻeki langa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Ko e fuofua sīpinga naʻe langa ʻi he ʻenisini tuku fakaholo Quake III Arena (GPL) pea naʻe ʻomi e ngaahi vaka mei he Elite Dangerous ko e fakaloloma. ʻI he ʻaho uá naʻe hiki e koniseti ʻo e kēmi ki he BuB, ko ha ʻenisini foʻou naʻe tohi ʻaki e Claude Code; naʻe haʻu e ngaahi konga ʻo e kēmi mei he fuofua sīpinga pea liliu hono ngaahi hingoa. Ko e vaʻa 0.3.0 naʻe ʻomi ai ki he kalasi vaka ʻe 16 kotoa ha ngaahi sino foʻou. ʻOku sivisivi ʻe ha vakai ki he fakatatau ki he laiseni pe ʻoku kei maʻu mei he GPL ha konga ʻo e koniseti, pea pe ʻoku ofi ange ʻa e ngaahi fakakaukau vaka ki muʻa ki he meʻa naʻe fakaloloma ai. Naʻe fakahoko ʻi he <0/> ha sivi ʻaotomatiki ʻo e tatau ʻo e koniseti ki he tupuʻanga ʻo e fuofua sīpinga GPL, pea ʻoku kei fai e sivisivi ʻe he kau poto ki he ngaahi tatau naʻe maʻu. ʻE toe tohi pe toe fokotuʻu ha meʻa kotoa pē ʻoku maʻu mei ai. Kae ʻoua ke ʻosi e sivisivi, ʻoku ʻikai te tau pehē ko e tali ko e ʻikai.",
  "faq.questions": "Ngaahi fehuʻi",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Ngaahi vaka, ata, fakaʻilonga mo e ngaahi meʻa kehe, ʻo fakatatau ki he paʻanga ʻoku maʻu. <0>Ko e lekooti ʻi he peesi ni<\/0> ʻoku ne lisi e konga kotoa pē pea te ne fakahā e fetongi taki taha mo hono tokotaha tā ata.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Ko e ngaahi vaka mo e fakaleleiʻi kuo palani ke lava ʻo maʻu ʻaki e vaʻinga pe fakatau. Ko e founga ke tauhi totonu ai e ngaahi vaka totongi ʻi he tau ʻa e tokotaha ki he tokotaha ʻoku kei fakakaukau ki ai.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ko e palani ia: vaʻinga taʻetotongi mo e paʻanga ʻi he kēmi mo e teunga ʻoku fili. Teʻeki langa.",
