  "faq.windowsPcThere": "PC Windows. ʻIkai ha ʻaho ʻe hā mai ai pe totongi he taimi ni.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Ko e Anthropic, Claude mo e Claude Code ko e ngaahi fakaʻilonga fakangāue ia ʻa e Anthropic, PBC. Ko e Unreal Engine mo e Epic Games ko e ngaahi fakaʻilonga fakangāue ia ʻa e Epic Games, Inc. Ko e Blender ko ha fakaʻilonga fakangāue ia ʻa e Blender Foundation. Ko e Quake III Arena mo e Elite Dangerous ko e ngaahi fakaʻilonga fakangāue ia ʻa honau kau ʻaʻahi. Ko e hingoa kotoa pē ʻoku ʻa honau kau ʻaʻahi pea ʻoku ngāueʻaki pē ke fakaʻilongaʻi ʻa e ngaahi koloa ʻoku lave ki ai. ʻOku ʻikai fekauʻaki e Orion-81 mo ha taha ʻo kinautolu, pe tokoniʻi pe poupouʻi ʻe ha taha ʻo kinautolu.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Ko ha fakaʻamanaki. ʻIkai ha kaungā ngāue, fekauʻaki pe poupou.",
