  "footer.followKickstarter": "Muimui he Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Ngaahi kaungā ngāue ʻi he kahaʻu?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "ʻIkai ha ngaahi muimui. ʻIkai ha ngaahi kuki. Uepisaiti sivisivi. Ko e moʻoni kotoa pē ʻoku muimui ki he tohi tauhi ʻo e kaveinga; ʻikai ha meʻa heni ko ha fofola pe tukupā.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Teʻeki ʻi he ʻatā",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ko e meʻa ʻe taha ʻoku kei ʻātaʻa: ko e <0>sivisivi laiseni<\/0> ʻo e koniseti ʻo e kēmi naʻe haʻu mei he fuofua sīpinga GPL. Naʻe fakahoko ʻi he <1/> ha sivi ʻaotomatiki ʻo e tatau ʻo e koniseti ki he tupuʻanga ʻo e fuofua sīpinga, pea ʻoku kei fai e sivisivi ʻe he kau poto ki he ngaahi tatau naʻe maʻu.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Ko e Orion-81 ko e kaveinga kuo fakatupu kotoa ʻe he AI.<\/0> Ko e koniseti ʻa e Orion-81 pē naʻe tohi ʻe he Claude Code, ʻo fakahinohino ʻe he tokotaha kamataʻi; ko e ngaahi vaka, mape, tekisi mo e ongo naʻe fakatupu ʻe he ngaahi meʻangāue naʻe tohi ʻe he Claude Code. Ko e ngaahi tohi tuku fakaholo ʻoku ne ngāueʻaki ʻoku lisi ʻi lalo ʻi he <1>“ʻIkai faʻu ʻe AI”<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Hiku ʻo e uepisaiti",
