  "meta.description": "Ko e Orion-81 ko e kēmi tau ʻi he ʻatā ʻoku faʻu kotoa ʻaki e AI, ke lava ʻo ngāue ʻaki hono paʻanga ke ngāueʻi ha kau tokotaha tā ata mo e kau enisinia polokalama kuo mole ʻenau ngāue koeʻuhi ko e AI. Vakaiʻi e ngaahi vaka, mape mo e meʻatau kuo langa ʻi he taimi ni.",
