  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Ko e Economic Index ʻa e Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> ʻoku ne ʻilo ko e kau ngāue kei kamata ʻenau ngāue ʻoku nau mamata ki he lahi taha ʻo ʻenau ngāue ʻoku lava ke fai ʻe he AI.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Ko e fokotuʻutuʻu ʻo e tuʻutuʻuni fakapaʻanga ʻa e Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> ʻoku ne kole ki he ngaahi kautaha ke toe akoʻi mo toe tuʻu e kakai kae ʻikai tukuange.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Ko e sivisivi ʻa e Anthropic ki he fakamoʻoni ʻo e toe ako (<1/>)<\/0> ʻoku ne ʻilo ko e ngaahi polokalama fekauʻaki mo e tokotaha ngāue mo e tuʻunga ngāue ʻoku lelei taha.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Ko e kole ko e faingofua: ko e nofoʻanga Claude ʻe nima ke kamata ai. Kapau te lava e tokotaha kamataʻi ʻo fakafonu ia ʻaki ha kakai poto mo loto fiefia, te tau fakahā ʻa e founga ʻe lava ke ngāueʻaki ai e AI ʻaki ha loto lelei ke faʻu ha meʻa fakaʻofoʻofa.",
