  "why.fromBackers": "Mei he kau poupou",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "Ko ha kēmi faʻu ʻe he AI kuo fakahā kakato mo ha taumuʻa ʻe lava ke sivi ʻe he kau vaʻinga, kuo palani ke hiki ki he Unreal Engine 5 (vahe 3 ʻo e hala ki muʻa).",
  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Ko ha sīpinga kuo tohi kakato ʻo e langa fakatupu, mei he ʻenisini ki he kēmi (tohi tauhi, lekooti ngāue mo e vēsiona kotoa kuo fakatoleʻi kuo tauhi), pea mo ha sivi siʻisiʻi mo ngāue ʻo ha founga ʻe taha ʻe lava ke fakapaʻanga ʻaki e ngaahi lelei ʻa e AI ki he kakai ʻoku ne ngaohi ke tuku ngāue.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Taumuʻa paʻanga: ʻe fakahā.",
  "why.kickstarterRoadmapPhase": "Ko e Kickstarter (vahe 5 ʻo e hala ki muʻa) ko e ʻuluaki fakataha paʻanga ki he kakai lahi. Ko hono paʻanga ʻoku fakataumuʻa ke ngāueʻi e kau fakalele mo e kau tokotaha tā ata ʻuluaki kuo mole ʻenau ngāue koeʻuhi ko e AI (vahe 6), pea ʻe nau fetongi e koloa faʻu ʻe he AI ʻo taki taha. <0>Ko e meʻa ʻoku totongi ʻe he ʻuluaki fakataha, ʻo fakatatau ki he ngāue taki taha: ʻe fakahā.<\/0>",
  "why.linksContextOnly": "Ko e ngaahi fehokotaki ko e fakatefito pē pea ʻikai ke fakahā ai ha poupou.",
