  "why.orion81Tests": "Ko e Orion-81 ʻoku ne sivi ha founga siʻisiʻi ʻe taha ʻo e fakakaukau ko ia. Ko ha palani, ʻikai ha ngāueʻi ʻi he taimi ni.",
  "why.plannedPaidCredited": "Kuo palani: ngāue totongi mo hono fakahā e hingoa ʻoku fetongi e koloa faʻu ʻe he AI ʻo taki taha, ʻo fakatatau ki he paʻanga ʻoku maʻu.",
  "why.publishersEngineMakers": "Ma e kau pulusi mo e kau faʻu ʻenisini",
  "why.routesThatExist": "Ko e ngaahi hala ʻoku ʻi ai ʻi he ngaahi polokalama lahi ʻa e Anthropic ʻoku kau ai e Claude for Startups (ngaahi mataʻitohi mo e ngaahi houa fetuʻutaki ʻo e Applied AI) mo e ngaahi meʻa hoko ʻa e Claude Founder House. Ko e Orion-81 ʻe lava foki ke hoko ko ha feituʻu sivi ma e kau fakatotolo ʻoku ako ki he toe ngāue ʻoku fakapaʻanga ʻe he AI. ʻIkai ha felotoi pe poupou.",
  "why.studyingAiFunded": "ʻOku ke ako ki he toe ngāue ʻoku fakapaʻanga ʻe he AI? <0>ʻOku haʻu e fakamatala fetuʻutaki.<\/0>",
